   169	 * every downstream tag-based check (isMemfsEnabledOnServer, memfs-sync,
   170	 * hydrateMemfsSettingFromAgent) treats them as non-memfs — on every machine,
   171	 * forever. Stamping the tag atomically with creation guarantees lazy sync
   172	 * paths can finish the setup (clone, tool detach) even if this process dies.
